#: ../../desktop/client_features.rst:6
msgid "Activities"
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/client_features.rst:8
msgid "Open **Activities** in the client to see recent file activity and synchronization warnings. If files conflict, use **Resolve conflicts** to review them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/client_features.rst:11
msgid "Activities view with recent file changes, a sync warning, and a conflict"
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/client_features.rst:17
msgid "User status"
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/client_features.rst:19
msgid "If your server has the user status app, open your account in the settings dialog and click **Online status**. Choose your availability, enter a status message or select a suggested one, and choose when to clear it. Click **Set status message** to save it, or **Clear status message** to remove an existing message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/client_features.rst:23
msgid "User status dialog with availability, status message, and expiration controls"
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/client_features.rst:29
msgid "Search"
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/client_features.rst:31
msgid "Open **Search** in the client and enter a term to find files and other results from your Nextcloud server. Use the **Type**, **Date**, and **People** filters to narrow the results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/client_features.rst:34
msgid "Search results for Project with Type, Date, and People filters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/client_features.rst:40
msgid "Assistant"
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/client_features.rst:42
msgid "If your server provides the Assistant, open **Assistant** in the client to ask a question or continue a conversation. Select a conversation, type your message, and click **Send**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../desktop/client_features.rst:45
msgid "Assistant conversation with a question, response, and message field"
msgstr ""
